  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British Euro-Atlantic Language Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the English language skills of targeted civil servants will smooth Ukraine&#x2019;s path towards EU membership and Euro-Atlantic integration, which is a key pillar of the UK&#x2019;s approach to securing Ukraine&#x2019;s future stability. Wider development of English language in Ukraine will support the Ukrainian economy and increase the competitiveness of Ukrainian business, science, education, innovation, and government, in line with both Country Plan and emerging UK-Ukraine 100-year- partnership priorities. Project is also linked to British Council&#x2019;s ongoing investment in Ukrainian education standards and opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
